   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sm&#xE5;projekt Serbien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delegated funding to the Swedish Embassy in Belgrad, for small short- term projects. The projects will be planned and handled by the Embassyand Sida Stockholm will pay the implementing partner directly upon completion. The programme is for year 2000-2001 and the goal is to support the democratisation process in Serbia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Delegerade medel till ambassaden i Belgrad f&#xF6;r sm&#xE5; kortsiktiga projektmed syfte att st&#xF6;dja demokratiseringsprocessen i Serbien. G&#xE4;ller f&#xF6;r &#xE5;r 2000-2001. Ambassaden handl&#xE4;gger, Sida Stockholm utbetalar direkt till genomf&#xF6;rare.</narrative>
  </description>
